<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Tested on the FLATLINE in Apex Legends. Nearly 100% accurate.

This script jitter your aim so that the shots go in the center. Use sentivirty 2 for best results. It was tweaked so that all shots hit the target without needing to ajust anything.
</Description>
